(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hang Samoeun, Advisor to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Representative of General Kun Kim, Senior Minister, First Deputy Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, on the morning of July 1, 2021, held a coordination meeting between NEC. Km And Cambodia Development Partners in collaboration with the Joint Working Group on HRF and JAG, representing the United Nations Development Partners and PPC on Disaster Management in Cambodia.
The meeting identified countries at risk of disaster to climate change. To address the risks of drought, floods and strong winds in some provinces, climate change in agriculture, water resources and rural development.
