Samdech Techo Hun Sen is determined to strengthen and deepen the relationship between the Cambodian People's Party and the Chinese Communist Party
(Phnom Penh): Not only did he congratulate and admire the great achievements of the Chinese Communist Party over the past 100 years, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the leader of the Cambodian People's Party, the ruling party in Cambodia. Declared unwavering commitment to strengthen and deepen the relationship between the Cambodian People's Party and the Chinese Communist Party.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his commitment to strengthening the relationship between the CPP and the Chinese Communist Party in a letter to Xi Jinping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee. Celebrating the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China.
"Under the wise leadership of the Communist Party of China, the People's Republic of China has achieved unity, harmony and prosperity, even though China is the most populous country in the world and has a rich history," he said. "Even though there are many different ethnic groups."
Samdech Techo added, "I would also like to take this opportunity to express my heartfelt appreciation to the Communist Party of China for its resolute commitment and hard work over the past hundred years." "The Chinese Communist Party has faced many obstacles and finally brought great progress and prosperity by changing the history of the country and the destiny of its people."
He also highlighted that China has become the world's second largest economy and the first developing country to achieve the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals. A) On the Elimination of Poverty by the UN by 2030. In addition, China has made remarkable scientific and technological achievements that have made significant contributions to world peace, development and prosperity.
"I commend the policy of the Chinese Communist Party, which places the people at the heart of the political decision-making process and initiatives," he said. The party strives to improve the living standards of the people by achieving poverty eradication and building a prosperous society in all fields. "Currently, the Chinese Communist Party has been committed and striving to build a Chinese-style socialism for the new era." Samdech Techo added.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a close partner in building relations with China in both the current party and state frameworks, has expressed strong belief in the great success of the Chinese Communist Party in deep and comprehensive reform. And all aspects that promote high-quality economic development and provide clear direction for new policies for national development.
Samdech Techo expressed his commitment to build relations with the Chinese Communist Party: "I would like to make unwavering commitment to strengthen and deepen the close ties and strong cooperation between the Cambodian People's Party. "And the Chinese Communist Party at all levels."
Samdech Techo, President of the Cambodian People's Party, also highly appreciated the new model of the Communist Party of China on party-party relations through the promotion of mutual respect, mutual learning and understanding. Common points, leaving differences apart.
Samdech Techo strongly believes that the Communist Party of China will achieve its second 100-year goal of building a modern, prosperous, democratic, prosperous and harmonious socialist country by 2049.
