2: Continue online skills training and strengthen the diversion of this training to target (training both new staff and employees who are affected by the Kovid crisis 19).
4: Continuing the work of promoting domestic tourism and raising public awareness to national and international tourists, especially all relevant institutions, the strategic plan for the implementation of the tourism sector, which currently has the Ministry of Roadmap on the plan to restore and promote tourism. Cambodia in and after the Kovid Crisis 19 Siem Reap Tourism Development Master Plan 2021-2035 and the continued implementation of three measures to prevent and protect tourism safety.
