* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if there is a death, there will be information, organizing ceremonies and lowering the flag to mourn.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent to those rumor makers to take care of their health better than worrying about Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for the past 18 months, Cambodia has jointly fought and managed the situation of Kovid 19 well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the November 3 event and the landing of the Western Dam was a big event that Cambodia could control.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that allowing Westdam to dock was one of Cambodia's greatest humanitarian gestures, bringing to the memory of all tourists on board.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on June 30, another 999 new cases were found, while the death toll rose to 602.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that North Korea may be experiencing an outbreak of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen outlines some measures to combat Kovid 19 in the February 20 event. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that more than 400,000 families were supplied with food by the Royal Government when the Royal Government implemented blockade measures.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government spends more than $ 40 million a month to help solve the hardships of about 700,000 families, plus workers in the garment and tourism sectors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has not reached the level of bankruptcy, there is no money to pay the civil servants of the Armed Forces, as advertised by some people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the income from the royal sponsorship from the King, Samdech Mey and the support from the philanthropists is more than 122 million 236 thousand 575 dollars.
* The Royal Government purchased Fungme Hospital for $ 15.4 million to treat 19 Kovid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that more than 400,000 families were supplied with food by the Royal Government when the Royal Government implemented blockade measures.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that these funds are a major contribution of the compatriots in the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is looking forward to learning from Vietnam's experience on community-based cross-border management in Ho Chi Minh City.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges attention to be paid to the control of cross-border travel between Cambodia and Thailand and requires custody at all borders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at the Vietnamese border where Vietnamese expats live, travel to Vietnam is temporarily banned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not possible to say that Cambodia copied to Thailand, Thailand copied to Cambodia, Cambodia copied to Vietnam, Vietnam copied to Cambodia or Cambodia copied to Laos or Laos copied to Cambodia. Now is not the time to blame each other, it is time to strengthen cooperation to fight disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all border crossings must be tested quickly and, if necessary, tested with more machines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that currently Cambodia has 1,144,450 rapid tests for the future, while another 1 million will arrive in the future and 300,000 for the strategic stockpile.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Health to make some adjustments and not to continue conservatism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia is poor, it does not allow Cambodian workers to return from Thailand to face hardships, but must provide sufficient supplies for charitable work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ordered Mr. Kheng Someth to go to the border provinces to inspect the construction of various facilities at the Chattalysak Center.
* Samdech Techo confirmed that the Thai side has already confirmed that for those who work illegally in Thailand during the time of Kovid 19, there will be no punishment and will also help to provide legitimacy. Samdech Techo calls on workers to refrain from rushing from Thailand to Cambodia at risk of infection.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces a strategy to reduce the number of infected areas and keep the number of infections low by using educational, health, administrative and legal measures.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who violated the laws or measures of the Royal Government and the authorities on the fight against Kovid 19 have filed a lawsuit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces a strategy to seek ways to treat patients and reduce deaths to zero.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the more than one year of the fight against Kovid 19, the Ministry of Health owed 5% to Samdech and Samdech owed up to 95%.
