* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces a strategy to prepare for the good burial or cremation of 19 Kovid patients according to 4 measures: Prepare the postage in the place where there is no postage, use the postage at the pagoda, but must ensure safety by working with the pagoda's chief priest, Prepare land for traditional burial of Khmer and Muslim minorities and prepare proper coffins for cremation or burial.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces a strategy to purchase 19 Kovid vaccines for at least 10 million people in the first phase and for children under 18 years of age.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces China as a strategic reference in the supply of vaccines.
