The introduction of General Neth Savoeun this morning, June 30, 2021, in the meeting to review the situation and the results of the operation to maintain security and social order, as well as the results of the implementation of the first half action plan and the second half of the year. 2021 via video system.
General Neth Savoeun praised the achievements of the National Police throughout the country in the first half of 2021 and predicted the situation in the future to be ready to take measures to ensure social security. In particular, announced the new situation facing the Kovid-19 epidemic and the new evolution of this deadly disease.
The General Commissioner of the National Police recommended the following key recommendations:
* The National Police Force throughout the country must be vigilant and must strictly implement the health rules, especially in accordance with the measures of the Royal Government "3 prevent and 3 do not" to prevent the spread of Kovid-19, which as a force The force must have two forces: it must absolutely protect itself, its family and protect the lives of the people as well as the society as a whole.
* Based on the plan set out for the second half, all unit leaders should pay attention to guide the development of action plans according to their specialization and geographical responsibilities, with assignments, implementation and monitoring. Thorough and highly effective.
* Must continue to strengthen national security measures to prevent terrorism, transnational crime and any tactics that attempt to overthrow the legitimate Royal Government. Strive to reduce all kinds of crimes, including the fight against drugs, anti-human trafficking, crime, gangsterism, illegal gambling of all kinds, etc. In particular, all crime-fighting operations must be vigilant to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
* Monitor and improve the work of road traffic, including changing the attitude of officials who stand by the goal, monitor the strict implementation of the law on road traffic, be strict and lively.
* Must pay attention to the health status of the living forces, especially the intervention forces, must have regular control over the accommodation, food, hygiene and health, adhere to health rules to encourage and maintain the strength of the service force. Give the operation.
* The Border Police Force shall prepare and implement an action plan to prevent illegal entry and exit and must cooperate with the Kovid-19 Commission in the area to thoroughly control the people who cross the border into Cambodia. At the same time, we must pay close attention to the health of the border guards by doing our best to implement the health rules and the Rapid Test in case of suspicion.
* Ensure that the situation is concentrated and the communication system is strengthened to ensure the flow of control. At the same time, it is necessary to promote the implementation of the work of the Association of Friends of the National Police (sick officers ...) and to strengthen the implementation of the discipline of the National Police Force, as well as to encourage outstanding officers.
To serve as a staff member of the Anti-Kovid-19 Commission at all levels, especially the Post Administration Police must strengthen the control of the population in the Kovid-19 situation by strictly implementing administrative measures and fines for individuals who violate health rules, as well as Regulations in force aimed at ending the Kovid-19 epidemic.
