Since the founding of the new China, GDP has increased 56 times. China's economic, defense, science and technology strength has risen dramatically, technology in industry, agriculture, defense and science have reached the world's leading level.
As for the construction of high-speed rail at the beginning of this century, China did not have high-speed rail. But to date, China, the world's most populous country, has the world's largest high-speed rail network. By 2020, 75 percent of China's cities with a population of more than 500,000 will have high-speed rail. It is estimated that by 2035, the total length of China's high-speed rail will increase to 70,000 km.
In terms of economic development, in the last 30 years, China has been a breakthrough in economic development, becoming the second largest economy in the world. The Chinese Communist Party has made the ideals and beliefs associated with economic development, planned and implemented economic policies related to China's great economic achievements, shocked the world.
This figure shocked the foreign media and made them feel that China is such a great country that people believe in their country almost unconditionally. In this regard, Kerry Brown, a British expert on China, said that over the past 40 years, China has successfully developed its economy with significant achievements in improving people's living standards and improving their living standards. Infrastructure and so on.
He noted that the West should recognize this, China should not be considered a student in some areas, the Chinese people can teach the West a lot of experience. Through a hundred years of development, history and the Chinese people have chosen the Communist Party of China, the Communist Party of China has always adhered to the people's priority, and has undergone continuous self-reform, sincere support from the people. China.
