2: Continue online skills training and strengthen the diversion of this training to target (training both new staff and employees who are affected by the Kovid crisis 19). As of June 22, 2021, 6,489 employees have received online training.
Mr. Thong Khon told the meeting that after the closing event in April, the domestic tourism movement has recovered, although lower than in the same period in 2020. As of June 2021, Cambodia received a total of more than 2 million domestic tourists, a decrease of 62.45% compared to the same period in 2020. Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Provides Food to 5 Municipal / District Police Inspectorates to Support Troops
