The decision to detain the accused was made this morning, June 29, 2021, after Deputy Prosecutor Song Chhavorn was charged with "falsifying the national police uniform, falsifying documents of the National Police." Documents of the Ministry of Interior and impersonating the Deputy Director of the Department of Anti-Drug Crimes.
It should be noted that on the morning of June 28, 2021, the Criminal Police Department sent the suspect, Sao Kho Chansolar, to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to be handed over to the Prosecutor's Office for investigation and prosecution. After the suspect was arrested in connection with impersonating the Deputy Director of the Department of Anti-Drug Crimes in Chamkar Ovulk 1 Village, Sangkat Kakap 1, Khan Por Sen Chey on June 24, 2021.
The suspect forged the National Police ID card (identity card fraud), forged the Ministry of Interior's announcement on the promotion of National Police officers and illegally used the national police uniform, forged the mission letter of the Central Judicial Police Department to be the Deputy Director of the Department. Against drug offenses, forgery of mission documents of the Central Department of Judicial Police, use and trafficking of illegal weapons.
(Koh Kong): Mrs. O Vandin, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Health and Chair of the Commission for Kovid 19 Vaccination, on the morning of June 29, 2021, handed over 10 million Riels and other materials of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presents 19 million 4 million Kovid vaccines to disabled fighters in Botum Sakor District, Koh Kong Province.
