(Phnom Penh): Coalition forces on June 27, 2021, yesterday confiscated a lion from a Chinese man who was raising a lion like a family member.
In this confiscation, the authorities claim that the law clearly states that people do not have sufficient rights to raise rare animals, for example, such as the lion. It has been confirmed that the lion will be taken to Phnom Tamao National Park to be managed by a professional officer.
Out of love for the animals he had raised since he was a child, the Chinese owner of the lion was taken away by the authorities and released at the Tamao Zoo, according to the family. From childhood, with love, just like any other animal. Raising is his family does not raise for sale, he raises like any other animal in his house.
Looking back at the impact of expression on Facebook, they similarly said that the release in Phnom Tamao was as good as the Chinese adopted? When this lion was under Chinese rule, his life was like that of a rich man who took good care of him day and night. On the contrary, can it be the same for Phnom Tamao?
However, all this is just a rumor on social media, as the lion has already been released by experts in Phnom Tamao, and officials have confirmed that it is illegal to raise an animal. This too. But they are expecting something in return for the time they are giving up.
Finally, the lion owner would like to ask the professional officer to facilitate the fine for him, because he is a Cambodian living in Cambodia and does not know that this breeding is wrong.
