A century in which the Chinese Communist Party has led the Chinese people towards a prosperous and prosperous life
(Beijing): Speaking of ancient civilizations in Asia, we often think of China, which has a history of more than 5,000 years. When it comes to world economic powers, we also think of China, the world's second largest economy, which has been dubbed the "Asian giant dragon." In terms of space strength, China, which has achieved outstanding achievements in this field, is also highly regarded by the whole world.
After all, achieving what it is today is not a matter of one or two days: China has gone through countless storms, including chronic civil war and foreign aggression, and it has taken nearly a century to recover. Restore its splendor.
The feudal society, which dates back more than 2,300 years, has inscribed the prosperity, sweetness and bitterness of Chinese history. The formation of the Chinese Communist Party is arguably one of the greatest inventions in modern Chinese history.
Since becoming the ruling party, the Chinese Communist Party has brought many historic achievements to the motherland, which has led people across the country to swim through hardships towards the shores of prosperity and prosperity. Dignity equals the world's great powers.
Achieving a socially prosperous society by 2020 is the first goal of the first 100 years of struggle. Then work for another 15 years, achieving the construction of a modern socialist country by 2035. From 2035 to the middle of this century, that is, around 2049, the goal of the second 100-year struggle will be achieved.
As we have all seen, last year China fulfilled its historic task, as well as the historic task of humanity, since its reform and opening up in 1978. Get nearly 800 million poor people out of poverty.
China's poverty reduction achievements have not only enriched its people, but also made significant contributions to global poverty reduction in the context of Kovid-19 and growth. Of the absolute poor around the world, China's success in reducing poverty has brought experience and confidence to the world.
"China's speed" is strong evidence of the strong development of China's economy. High-speed rail can be said to be the new name of China's road infrastructure network, which has the longest total length in the world and is at the forefront of the world.
The policy of harmonization, sharing, win-win cooperation and joint development of the Chinese Communist Party has made more and more people around the world see the value and benefits of multilateralism and China's role in world peace and stability. As an anchor for global economic stability, China has always brought strong confidence to the international community.
The wheel of China's new history is slowly moving forward, the Chinese Communist Party, which was born on the red boat and has grown into a giant ship that can cross the big waves and help cover the storms for people all over the country. Has been leading its people towards the shores of prosperity as well as bringing more benefits to the whole world.
