(Phnom Penh): June 28 is the 70th anniversary of the Cambodian People's Party to show the political activities and great achievements for the nation and the people throughout the kingdom to lead with courage. At all major stages of Khmer history.
What stages did the 28th anniversary of the Cambodian People's Party on June 28 go through in Khmer history?
Khmer civilization expert Mr. Rath Sandab described that on June 28, the 70th anniversary of the glorious Cambodian People's Party, now in terms of background is one of the oldest parties among the party. Politics in our kingdom as well as in the region.
Through this background, the party has overcome countless obstacles in the course of Cambodian history to reach a peaceful and prosperous country as we see it today.
In other words, for this resistance movement, we can call it "multi-movement" because there are different ideological tendencies, but there is only one direction: the liberation of the country from the French colonialism. Because the resistance movement cooperated with the resistance movements of Vietnam and Laos, which also had a policy of expelling French colonists from their respective countries.
This means that at that time, the resistance movement was in line with the geographical situation, politics and circumstances of the country. On the other hand, as villagers and fences together and have common enemies, cooperation is also necessary.
Based on this resistance movement, the Khmer Revolutionary People's Party formed an army resistance movement called "Unity Revolutionary Armed Forces of Cambodia" which was established on June 19, 1951 in Sre Ambel district, Kampot province. Tou Samuth is the commander. Until the Geneva Accords in June 1954, eight months after independence, the resistance movement was disbanded in line with the independence of the country and shifted from armed resistance to politics.
2. When the country fell into the flames of war by dropping foreign invaders from 1970-1975, especially the country fell into the genocidal regime disaster of 1975-1979, the party led the struggle to overthrow this vicious regime. Until the historic success on January 7, 1979, by liberating the nation and saving the lives of the people in time, bringing back the rights, freedoms, democracy and dignity to the people.
Mr. Rath Sandab continued that, on June 28, the 70th anniversary of the glorious Cambodian People's Party, we, the people, should remember it as a national background because it has brought peace and all kinds of development to the Kingdom. .
Based on these values, the CPP is a strong backbone in defending the constitution, monarchy and political stability by preventing all kinds of color revolutionary tactics that push Cambodia away from the path of democracy and the rule of law.
Therefore, the Cambodian people must study and understand their history clearly in order to avoid falling into the same catastrophe as in the past, especially to absolutely avoid the change of political regime.
