(Phnom Penh): In order to facilitate the livelihood of cyclo drivers during the Kovid-19 crisis, on the morning of June 27, 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen Ms. Hun Mana, Director General of Bayon Radio and Television, donated some food items to 300 cyclo operators in Phnom Penh.
The donation ceremony was held at Bayon TV, Boeung Snour, and was organized by Mr. Chin Bunthoeun and some other team members.
On that occasion, Mr. Chin Bunthoeun sent a message from the leadership to greet the cyclo riders, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Katiprittbandit, who always think about the well-being of the cyclo riders at all times.
He also reminded the elderly cyclo riders to take care of their health, especially to protect themselves from the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
