The Ministry would like to support, encourage and look forward to additional cooperation in processing techniques, packaging and some relevant legal procedures to help reduce environmental impact, environmental competition and climate change, which is an important policy. The importance of the Royal Government as well as the Ministry for the development of a sustainable, sustainable and prosperous agricultural sector.
