The two sides considered that today's talks are very important in strengthening the friendly relations and bilateral cooperation between the two Ministries of Defense of Cambodia and Japan, aimed at enhancing the capacity of the defense, political security and humanitarian sectors through training. Human resources to have the intellectual capacity to contribute to building closer military ties between the two countries and deepen and prosper.
In addition, this cooperation promotes strategic cooperation, which is a progress and a key factor for strengthening closer cooperation to serve bilateral, regional and global affairs, which is a solid foundation of friendship under all circumstances. Mutual benefit and prosperity for the army and the people of both Cambodia and Japan.
