(Kandal): The chicken farm of Mr. Chheang Tang, son of Prek Koy commune chief, at the back of North Saang Market in Trapeang Chhouk village, Prek Koy commune, Saang district, Kandal province, was reported by villagers to have violated the Romia Chap River and yielded Seriously affecting the environment for their livelihood there.
