On behalf of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Minister Veng Sakhon expressed his appreciation and appreciation to Heifer International Cambodia for its contribution to the development of the Khmer vegetable and chicken production chain of the farming community, ensuring productivity, quality, safety and job creation. And income in the context of the Kovid-19 epidemic.
He hopes that the organization will continue to examine the possibility of providing more support to the farming community to meet the practical needs of transporting vegetables, fruits, fish, meat to markets, supermarkets, hotels, restaurants and other retail outlets to maintain Get fresh quality, save time, reduce the loss of quantity or quantity of products caused by transportation and refrigeration for storing products, etc.
