Mr. Suy Sem made the remarks while presiding over the inauguration ceremony of Renexin Mineral Gold Refinery in O'Khvav, Chong Plas Commune, Keo Seima District, Mondulkiri Province on the morning of June 21, 2021. .
He stated that the gold mining business is a new business, a new income and the first history that the income from this gold mine is put in the national budget and the national budget is used for economic and social development.
He added that the estimated annual revenue of about $ 40 million is national revenue from royalties and taxes on gold sales at the site. All these revenues will be included in the national budget for economic and social development as a whole. This is like a bag that the Ministry of Economy and Finance holds and manages.
Mr. Suy Sem said that the presence of the Renewable Mineral Cambodia Limited gold refinery, which was opened on June 21, 2021, is the first record in the history of the start of Cambodia's gold mining industry. And this is a testament to the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
He said that along with the above economic benefits, the operation of the gold mine business and plant will make a significant contribution to the creation of national capacity and a new industrial model for the exploitation of mineral resources in a responsible and efficient manner. Sustainable development.
