(Kandal): Buddhists and the committee of Koh Thmey pagoda protested in front of the pagoda in Koh Thmey village, Khpob commune, Saang district, Kandal province, to ask Venerable E Piseth, who lives in Koh Thmey pagoda, to show the total suffix. 120 million riels and more than 9,000 dollars to prove to the Buddhists because they suspect that they are missing and do not know what to use.
The people and the committee of Koh Thmey pagoda said that the reason they protested was because they saw that this monk was dishonest and had many wrongdoings and was not suitable as a monk. Make the Buddhists at the foot of the pagoda lose faith and want to build something in the pagoda, willing to do it themselves, such as the case of building a pagoda fence and a pavilion.
Moreover, the story that they lost more and more faith, as they came to worship and ask about the construction of a concrete road to the pagoda and a concrete road along the fence in front of the pagoda, suddenly the monk insisted that there was no construction. Only cut pagoda land for sale.
Not only that, this monk also wants to dissolve the pagoda committee. In the case of the dissolution of the pagoda committee, the people and the pagoda committee suspect that the dissolution of the pagoda committee is that this monk intends to hide the aftermath of 120 million riels and more than 9,000 dollars. Look.
The incident also lasted until the evening of the 17th of the same month, when the people and the pagoda committee came to the pagoda to solve it, but Venerable E Piseth refused to confirm the order with the media regarding this case. . Koh Thmey village chief Ko Vary said he did not know about this, he came to this pagoda because the monk Episeth called to solve but did not know what to solve.
