Tragic traffic accident in Kampong Trabek district, Prey Veng province, 3 mothers were killed and 2 children were seriously injured
(Prey Veng): A horrific traffic accident caused the death of three mothers at the scene, while two other children were seriously injured on National Road No. 1 at the point between km 90-91. In Chrolong village, Prasat commune, Kampong Trabek district, Prey Veng province.
According to the police, this incident happened on the afternoon of June 19, 2021, while the victim was driving a motorcycle taxi from Phnom Penh back to his hometown, met with a traffic accident. The victim resides in Trabek Phong village, Ta Suos commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province.
Police said that before the incident, the victim was seen riding a motorcycle driving from west to east, with four daughters and two sons in front, two sitting in a bag and two in the back. At the top, collided with a fully loaded tuk-tuk trailer.
The same source said that the son and daughter sitting in the front broke their heads and died immediately, while the mother lost her head from her body and died immediately, while the son and daughter in the back were seriously injured and fainted. The tuk-tuk driver fell into the field, then the tuk-tuk driver fled the scene, leaving only the tuk-tuk trailer at the scene.
After the incident, the police arrived to measure and call the ambulance to send the victim to Kampong Trabek District Hospital and sent to Svay Rieng Provincial Hospital, while the body of the mother and child were handed over to the family for the traditional ceremony.
According to the victim's husband, his wife never quarreled and the children visited Phnom Penh for more than 10 days and were too bored to stay at home because they were afraid of Kovid, so his wife sent the children home. In Svay Rieng province.
Sources from the husband said that the victim's wife, Chen Nouch, 39, was born in Kampot province, and her daughter Sna Srey Pov, 10, and son Sna Bunleap, 3. At present, the bodies of his wife and two children are being kept at home in Trabek Phrong village, Ta Suos commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province for a traditional ceremony.
