Mr. Sovannara, a frog farmer in Siem Reap province, also said that there was no market for frogs due to the import of frogs from Vietnam to sell to Cambodia, so customers who used to buy local frogs returned to buy Vietnamese frogs under the pretext of Vietnamese frogs. Cheaper than domestic frogs.
