Authorities confirmed that the arrested suspect was 74-year-old Chheng Phon, a farmer in Trapeang Khmum village, Kraing Makak commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province. Authorities said that before the incident, the mother lost her daughter and could not find her at home. It was not until 12:20 that he saw his son walking out of the bush behind the house, then he saw the suspect walking behind him.
