Why the Shanghai Cooperation Organization has been able to make great progress in the past 20 years. In general, in the early days of the founding of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, the "Shanghai spirit" was defined and initiated to build trust, mutual benefit, equality, dialogue, respect for civilization and search. Developing together.
This is a progressive concept of cooperation that has driven the member states of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO) to achieve outstanding and fruitful results in security cooperation, economic development and civil dialogue.
In the field of economic and trade cooperation, over the past 20 years, the total volume of China's exports and exports with other member states of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization has increased from 17.14 billion US dollars. Initially, it reached 244.85 billion US dollars, and the average annual growth rate reached 15 percent.
More importantly, the Shanghai Cooperation Organization has always supported and practiced multilateralism and established a new model of international relations on mutual respect, justice and truth, as well as cooperation and win-win. - Win.
Experts explain that the case that the British and German armies destroyed Swift's nose is not possible because there are photographs of Swinger with a severed nose since 1886 AD. The case of Emperor Napoleon is also not true, because the Swift painting of the nose is already from the year 1737 AD, that is, 32 years before Napoleon was born.
However, to this day, the Egyptian tour guide who serves tourists at the Pyramids still tells tourists that the broken Swift's nose was stolen by Napoleon. France and is currently housed in the Museum of Paris, while in the Paris Museum there is no display of Swift's nose.
