Two couples in Boribo district, Kampong Chhnang province, were hit by an East Asia bus, killing their daughter and sister for more than a year, but have not yet received compensation
(Kampong Chhnang): Two couples, parents and siblings of the victims who died in traffic accidents, said that they have not yet received compensation from the other party, the driver of the East Asia Company bus. He crashed into his daughter and sister more than a year ago.
