On March 29, 2020, Khon Lim, 38, and her husband Phim Sovy, 40, of Dang Khao Mao village, Chak commune, Baribo district, said with tears in their eyes that their daughter, Chhean Kimly, 16, and her younger brother Her name is Phim Sineang, 31 years old. She rode two motorbikes from her house to Trapeang Chan commune in a north-south direction along National Road 5.
At Neak Ta Po Road, an East Asia bus with license plate number 3C-4760 collided head-on with the motorcycle on the right side of the road, injuring his daughter and another sister. Died immediately at the scene, while the motorcycle was completely destroyed.
After the incident, they went to receive the bodies of their children and sisters from the authorities to celebrate with the saddest and most regretful. Cars and motorcycles were taken away by the police and a legal case was sent to court.
