(Phnom Penh): His Majesty the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, has decided to appoint Mr. Hoeun Samneang as the Director of Techo Sen Public Works and Transport Institute, the first training institute on road and bridge construction. In Cambodia.
