Mr. Hoeun Samneang is a former Cambodian monk who studied deeply in Buddhism for 19 years at Wat Damnak and participated in many national and international social and Buddhist activities.
Please note that Techo Sen Institute of Public Works and Transport is the first training institute for road and bridge construction as well as infrastructure in Cambodia. The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) built and officially inaugurated the Techo Sen Institute of Public Works and Transport on January 22, 2021 under the highest presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
