BEIJING (Xinhua) - The Central Committee of the Communist Party of China (CPC) and the State Council of the People's Republic of China (PRC) recently issued guidelines on providing support to Zhejiang for high-quality development and the establishment of rich model areas. Have fun together.
The Central Committee of the Communist Party of China (CPC) and the State Council of the People's Republic of China (PRC) have set up a top-level design to support Zhejiang Province in high-quality development and create a rich model area together, and set out the 2025 development goals. 2035 and 20 key measures in 6 areas.
Zhejiang Province has been in charge as a model area, but this does not mean that from now on, the development of Zhejiang Province only depends on the province planning and promoting implementation. In order to fulfill the important tasks set out in the "Guidelines", Zhejiang Province needs to cooperate extensively with other regions of China, as well as businesses, enterprises and research institutes in various fields.
Therefore, the Chinese Communist Party Commission of Zhejiang Province has systematically analyzed the advantages and disadvantages of Zhejiang Province in terms of addressing a number of issues, such as accelerating the narrowing of the development gap between regions and areas, and accelerating the narrowing of the urban-rural development gap. As well as accelerating the narrowing of the income gap.
