He added that the successful sale of carbon credits on the Cambodian volunteer market has been successful in the past and it is a source of pride for Cambodia that we are involved, especially in Southeast Asia, Cambodia being one of the first countries to sell credit. Carbon.
He pointed out that this is a pride that Cambodia was previously criticized by some people that Cambodia is an area that loses its forest through deforestation, etc. And etc. Therefore, through Cambodia's commitment to the protection of forests and natural resources through the sale of carbon credits on the voluntary market, this is in line with the Royal Government's policy on forest protection.
