"The use of tobacco products, such as inhaled tobacco, often involves the sharing of mouth-to-mouth straws, which carry the 19 virus into the community and society," she said. The World Health Organization (WHO) study on smoking and Kovid 19 found that smoking was associated with an increase in the incidence and mortality of 19 Kovid hospitalized patients.
