It should be noted that economic diplomacy is one of the five priorities of the Cambodian foreign policy line set by the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, including:
1: Defending independence, national sovereignty, territorial integrity, neutrality, maintaining the absolute protection of peace, stability, order and social unity 2: Increasing external friends based on the spirit of national independence 3: Economic diplomacy 4: Continuing to support and strengthen multilateralism 5: Improve the quality, efficiency and capacity building of Cambodian diplomats.
