(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, said that the accusation that there is a Chinese military base in the Ream Sea, no matter how much Cambodia clarifies, the United States does not accept it because it is not in accordance with their intentions.
Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh said that during the meeting, Cambodia confirmed a lot on this issue and the US Deputy Secretary of State requested the US Joint Chiefs of Staff to visit Ream Naval Base.
Samdech Tea Banh emphasized that in response to the request of the US Deputy Secretary of State, the Prime Minister welcomed and allowed the US Joint Chiefs of Staff to visit and study the area at any time.
But for Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, the visit of the US Joint Chiefs of Staff to the Ream Sea could not end the US accusations against Cambodia. According to Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh, an officer of the US Joint Chiefs of Staff had visited there, and Samdech had given countless explanations, but they still did not recognize him.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, sees US Indo-Pacific politics and allies and the Belt and Road Policy as a 21st Century Geopolitical Battlefield between the United States and China, the World Power. .
More than half a century ago, rivalries between the United States, the liberal powers, and communist countries in Southeast Asia, especially Indochina (Cambodia, Vietnam, and Laos), plunged Cambodia into the flames of war. The flames of war lasted for more than three decades and ended with the win-win policy of Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen on June 29, 1998.
Today, the geopolitical colonies of the superpowers of China and the United States are seen to be heating up again. Cambodia is also one of the countries in the region of power struggle between China and the United States. This challenge raises concerns about the possibility of Cambodia slipping and falling into the flames of war as in the past.
In the ceremony of depositing the first drop of oil at the Victory Monument, a symbol of the end of the flames of war, find peace, unity and national unity this Wednesday, June 9, 2021, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh "This is not a normal thing and it is not new for Cambodia," he said.
Answer the question, how can Cambodia avoid the problem of competing for power of this great power? Samdech Pich Sena said that Cambodia has no choice but to follow the political line that has been adopted in the past, that is, neutral politics.
In addition to pursuing a policy of neutrality for Cambodian Defense Minister Samdech Pichey Sena, another option that Cambodia should adopt is cooperation. But for this cooperation, it is necessary to choose the cooperation that is beneficial, not the cooperation that leads to harm.
Samdech Picheay Sena Tea Banh added, "The first thing to do is to look at the benefits that we must get from the achievements of that cooperation." "If that cooperation destroys us, we do not need it. If that cooperation benefits us, we are happy to receive it for the sake of our motherland, our people."
