Mr. Chea Sovann, Deputy Inspector of Criminal Planning of the Police Inspectorate of Po Sen Chey District, told Fresh News on the afternoon of June 7 that the operation to arrest the perpetrator took place at 5:30 pm on June 5, 2021 in Village 2, Kampong Treas Commune, Krouch Chhmar District, Tbong Khmum Province.
Mr. Chea Sovann said that the suspect, Heng Chandy, 43, a motorbike taxi driver from the above village, was arrested for attempted murder, while his wife and the victim, 50-year-old Ly Rany, a security guard, were arrested. House for rent in Trapeang Thleung 1 village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Sen Chey.
Mr. Chea Sovann said that the suspect and the victim were not married or married, after living together for some time, the suspect broke up with another woman and lived with the new girl. It will take five years until 2020 to return to the victims and plead for reconciliation.
At that time, the victim refused, which made him angry until March 28, 2020 at 22:15 pm, while the victim was walking from work to close to a rented house in Trapeang Thleung 1 village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Sen Chey, the suspect also threw acid on his face, causing serious injuries. The victim then shouted for a neighbor to help, but the suspect grabbed the phone and fled.
Mr. Chea Sovann said that the woman was rushed to the hospital and did not file a complaint because she was seriously injured. Do research on this.
It was not until June 2, 2021, when the above suspect appeared, that he was doing martial arts in Village 2, Kampong Treas Commune, Krouch Chhmar District, Tbong Khmum Province, and reported to the Po Sen Chey District Police Force to cooperate with the Krouch Chhmar District Police Force to arrest him .
