Understand business: Well-known business people suggest that before starting a business, it is important to know 4 skills to make that business successful!
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Din Somethearith, a well-known businessman and the founder of Phka Trakoun Village, advised all business owners that before starting a business, they should have these four skills in hand first, because these four skills will help to open Business is successful.
Mr. Din Somethearith stated that in order to run a successful business, whether it is under the condition of Kovid 19 or normal conditions, there must be:
1: Good business idea
2: Must know entrepreneurship, this point means to know how to use other people's resources, must know how to use other people's skills, must know how to use other people's time and so on. To be an entrepreneur means to be brave, to be imaginative, highly creative and so on.
3: Must know management skills: refers to operational management, marketing management, sales management, financial management and so on.
4: Must know how to use digital technology, this point is important and help many businesses, as in the context of Kovid 19, despite the closure, the business can operate through this digital system.
He said that opening a business needs to be aware of the actual situation, such as during this period, you can not open a karaoke or a park or a club and a massage parlor, because it is against the Ministry of Health not to meet. However, some businesses can be opened, such as restaurants, etc., despite the constraints of the meeting, but still open, in addition, this business can also operate online by delivery to customers to the place.
"No matter what the business, the business owner must consider carefully, always run smart and careful," he said.
