(Phnom Penh): Mr. Suy San, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, representing Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, on June 3, 2021, led a delegation from the Ministry to pay their respects to the late Mr. Tram Iv Tek, Senior Minister in charge of Mission. Special and former Minister of Public Works and Transport at the mortuary located at 35, Street 285, corner of Street 556, Sangkat Boeung Kak I, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
