The leaders of the National Assembly of Cambodia and Vietnam pledged to continue to push for the achievement of all priorities in the agreement signed between the two parliaments in 2019, including the exchange of visits to each other. All special levels encourage the activities of friendly groups of young MPs and female MPs. The two parliaments continue to support each other in inter-parliamentary forums, both regionally and globally.
