Taking that opportunity, Samdech Heng Samrin thanked the National Assembly of Vietnam for providing about $ 25 million to the National Assembly of Cambodia for the construction of the administrative building, which so far the project is in the process of studying technical work. At the end of this year or early next year, a groundbreaking ceremony will be held, at which time the National Assembly of Cambodia will also invite Vietnamese leaders to attend.
