BEIJING: The 74th World Health Assembly closed on June 1. During the General Assembly, some US politicians once again inflated the issue of tracing the origin of the 19 Kovid virus, demanding that China cooperate with international investigations that attempt to blame China again.
After more than a year of outbreaks of Kovid 19, the United States has ignored the fact of failing to prevent and control the spread of Kovid 19 and the many doubts surrounding the origin of Kovid 19 virus. It is now "urging" China, which has invited the World Health Organization to conduct research on tracing the origins of the Kovid 19 virus, to receive an international investigation. Where does this reason come from?
The World Health Organization (WHO) study on the origin of the 19 viruses in China has now been completed. A joint investigation team between the World Health Organization and China released a report in late March this year stating that the Kovid 19 virus could not be transmitted to humans through laboratories.
After more than a year of 19 cases of Kovid, the United States continues to inflate rumors that the virus has leaked out of the lab. Their initiative is based on the prediction of such a fact that the United States itself has invested heavily in and used biological warfare.
