(Kandal): Vendors in North Saang Market, who sell baskets and make a small profit to support their families, have asked the Saang District Authority in Kandal Province to help them because there are people living next to Saang Market. At the foot of National Road 21, they measured meters on concrete roads and sidewalks on the corolla, set them to sell and charged from 40 to 50,000 riel per month.
