Ministry of Education Instruction on distance and electronic teaching and learning for public primary schools for the academic year 2020-2021 The NEC will use information technology in the 2021 Commune / Sangkat Council Election
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) said that on June 20, 2021, the NEC will hold a pilot election to elect commune councils using information technology. IT) To facilitate the election in the context of the Industrial Revolution 4.0 and the context of the spread of Kovid-19.
This is the emphasis of Mr. Dim Sovannarom, Member and Spokesperson of the NEC and Chairman of the first Jitsi Meet online stakeholder consultation meeting on the 2021 Commune / Sangkat Council Election. Held on the morning of May 28, 2021.
Mr. Dim Sovannarom said that the pilot election was an evaluation of the effectiveness of modernizing the electoral process within the framework of the NEC's electoral reform to move forward with the election. The future using IT.
He added that there should be no confusion over the conduct of the by-elections, which does not refer to online voting preparations, as no country has yet done so except Estonia, the only country in the world.
The NEC will use information technology (IT) systems to monitor, verify and evaluate work efficiency for:
* Registration of political parties and lists of candidates for digital or online voting * Use of ballot pens to support political parties, mark on ballots * Use of online verification and summary of election results (Online) which covers the main processes on Election Day through the following systematic programs:
- Program to receive, summarize, send and announce the preliminary results of the election - Program to verify and summarize the provisional results of the election - Program to verify and summarize the official results of the election - Program to allocate seats and list the names of elected candidates .
Mr. Dim Sovannarom stated that the opinions of all parties are input to contribute to the improvement of electoral procedures and technical work using IT before the NEC decides and officially launches the election. Commune / Sangkat Council, 5th mandate, 2022.
