Kratie Province sets 5-year plan for tourism development to contribute to poverty reduction, conservation of natural resources and culture
(Kratie): The Kratie Provincial Department of Tourism has just achieved the book "Tourism Update Plan for Kratie Province 2021-2025" to serve as a roadmap for the development of tourism to contribute to poverty reduction and resource conservation. Nature and culture throughout this province.
Mr. Bun Sambo, Deputy Director of the Department of Tourism in Kratie, told Fresh News on May 28, 2021 that the purpose of the five-year tourism development plan in Kratie is to:
* Develop new, unique and high-quality tourism products to supply the tourism market, such as agro-tourism, turning farms, orchards into recreational areas, providing agricultural experience, and transforming potential natural attractions into community-connected markets. Ecotourism sites.
* Improve existing tourist resorts and tourism communities by orienting in line with the standards of the model tourism and community tourism movement model. Employment for tourists contributes to increasing employment for the people, increasing income and reducing poverty.
* Promote the province's tourism sector to be an effective tool in conserving natural resources and local cultural resources as the best attraction.
* Develop Kratie tourism into attractive and sustainable cultural, historical, natural and recycled tourism destinations to attract 170,000,000 national tourists and about 17,000 international tourists in 2025 to contribute to the promotion Livelihood, welfare of the people.
Mr. Vice President Pon Sambo said, "Kratie Tourism Development Plan 2021-2025 is the most important compass and road map for all relevant institutions (public, private, partner organizations) in "The development of tourism in this province is more progressive, which can contribute to reducing poverty and conserving the precious natural resources of the community in Kratie."
He went on to say that in order to achieve this development, we need to work closely together to implement the action plan and promote tourism in the province, based on a strong common vision: "Let's transform the province together." "Kratie is a natural, cultural and attractive tourist destination in the Northeast region through the continued development of products to enhance the quality of sustainable tourism services."
However, the Kratie Provincial Department of Tourism will continue to study other destinations to examine the possibility of establishing additional ecotourism communities, especially along the upper Mekong River in Kratie province, because ecotourism communities are the only principle in the development of services. Let conservation work for development, that is, mechanisms for the protection and conservation of natural resources to improve community livelihoods.
The vision for the implementation of the Kratie Tourism Development Plan is to make Kratie a destination province for natural tourism, culture and culture, as well as the most attractive model province in the Northeast region through quality enhancement. To increase the quality of tourism products and create new unique tourism events to attract tourists to visit Kratie to double.
