At that time, the doctor chased her husband out and the doctor took oxygen from outside to save about 40 minutes later, due to the very uncomfortable condition, sent his wife to Calmette Hospital, but unfortunately. Upon arrival, Calmette Hospital told him his wife had died earlier.
In this case, Mr. Chhou Sokleap also filed a complaint to the Arey Ksat commune police station, complaining to the "Chea Rachana" maternity and maternity hospital to find a legal solution to the death of his wife and unborn child. Resting. However, the victim's family said that doctors confirmed that the death was due to an accident, not the negligence of doctors.
The victim's family claimed that during the ceremony, a representative of the Chea Rachana Hospital and Maternity Hospital also attended the funeral and received $ 1,000. Doctors later agreed with the victim's family to provide an additional $ 2,000, but the victim's family could not accept it.
Mr. Chhou Sokleap, who is currently raising two children alone after losing his wife, insisted through Fresh News to seek the intervention of the Ministry of Health so that his family can receive justice after the loss. Wife and unborn child.
