(Preah Vihear): Senior Minister Meas Sophea, Permanent Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Preah Vihear Provincial Central Working Group, instructed members of the CPP Working Group in the province to work as servants and assist in resolving all issues. The people's problems are the fundamental principles of the CPP and always lead the people to give common sense to support the CPP in its leadership.
He also reminded all members and working groups in the province to start reviewing important work and priorities in order to gain the trust and support of the electorate.
This was stated by Senior Minister Meas Sophea at a meeting on the Joint Plan for the 2022 Commune / Sangkat Council Election in Preah Vihear Province on May 26, 2021, with the participation of Mr. Prak Sovann. Chairman of the Provincial Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, Mr. Sous Yara, Member of Parliament for Preah Vihear Constituency and Chairman of the Deputy Chairman of the Central Working Group of Provinces, Municipalities, Districts, Communes and Sangkats.
